###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - Training-set sizes are from Table I (Manual 325, Incremental-2 82, -4 162, -6 242 of 867 configurations). For the Manual model the text says the comparison is 'for the test sets'; for the Incremental models Table II does not name the evaluation set.
# - Energy RMSEs are in eV per atom (no vocabulary unit; in the label). The registry label of entity:GAP says 'with SOAP kernel' although these models use pair and triplet descriptors only (legacy label, listed in METHODS.md). cutoffRadius is the two-body cutoff (8.0 A); other descriptor parameters (theta, delta) are not encoded.
# - Phonon dispersions, lifetimes and lattice thermal conductivities are not encoded. Read from the arXiv v1 preprint; arXiv id matched by title and author.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).

